# Copy to frontend/.env to turn on login. Leave blank (or omit the file) to run with no auth —
# the canvas loads straight to the empty state and every request is the single `local` user.
#
# Both must be set for the login gate to appear. Find them in your Supabase project under
# Project Settings → API. These are safe to ship in the client bundle (the anon key is public
# by design); the backend still verifies every token.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
